{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26526","headline":"送狄尚书镇太原 · 姚合","name":"送狄尚书镇太原","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"授钺儒生贵，倾朝赴饯筵。\n麾幢官在省，礼乐将临边。\n代马龙相杂，汾河海暗连。\n远戎移帐幕，高鸟避旌旃。\n天下屯兵处，皇威破虏年。\n防秋嫌垒近，入塞必身先。\n中外恩重叠，科名岁接连。\n散材无所用，老向琐闱眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26526.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26526","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}